WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.900
=Episode 6=

01:33.140 --> 01:34.300
Not He Yan?

01:34.500 --> 01:35.400
Wait, Mr. Shen.

01:35.400 --> 01:36.780
But He took first place.

01:37.020 --> 01:38.500
- He...
- First place, so what?

01:40.460 --> 01:41.340
Get back to it.

01:41.539 --> 01:42.380
Don't make a scene.

01:44.180 --> 01:45.259
Listen up, all of you.

01:45.259 --> 01:46.940
Commander selects the candidate

01:47.140 --> 01:49.060
based on a comprehensive evaluation.

01:50.100 --> 01:52.500
The competition was just one aspect.

02:07.660 --> 02:08.860
They've got poor judgment.

02:09.139 --> 02:09.979
Right.

02:09.979 --> 02:10.820
Come on.

02:11.300 --> 02:12.140
Let's drink.

02:12.140 --> 02:12.980
Let's drink.

02:13.540 --> 02:15.140
So eager to join the battalion?

02:19.140 --> 02:20.340
Only then

02:21.020 --> 02:22.340
can I earn merits in combats.

02:22.780 --> 02:24.420
Only then can I become a general.

02:25.820 --> 02:28.260
In such a hurry for glorious homecoming?

02:36.020 --> 02:37.100
I have no family.

02:40.620 --> 02:41.660
All I want

02:43.340 --> 02:44.740
is to prove my worth.

02:46.380 --> 02:47.220
Lei Hou

02:47.860 --> 02:49.260
is your defeated opponent.

02:49.900 --> 02:51.460
Huaijin chose him over you.

02:52.140 --> 02:53.180
That's his loss.

03:32.620 --> 03:33.620
Let's drink.

03:35.180 --> 03:36.020
Here.

03:38.700 --> 03:39.820
The Mid-Autumn Festival.

03:40.220 --> 03:41.140
Family reunion day.

03:41.940 --> 03:43.460
I'll drink my fill.

03:48.020 --> 03:48.860
Cheers.

03:50.700 --> 03:52.540
- Being happy, I won't get drunk.
- Eat a lot.

04:08.500 --> 04:09.340
Xiao Jue.

04:09.460 --> 04:10.500
You've gone too far!

04:11.620 --> 04:12.460
What did you call me?

04:17.380 --> 04:18.420
Xiao Jue.

04:21.940 --> 04:23.620
Are you stupid?

04:23.980 --> 04:26.500
You don't even know your name.

04:32.460 --> 04:33.300
Xiao Jue.

04:33.500 --> 04:34.860
Do you know who I am?

04:38.140 --> 04:38.980
Who are you?

04:47.140 --> 04:47.980
I

04:48.620 --> 04:49.860
have been walking around

04:49.860 --> 04:50.860
with only one name.

04:51.300 --> 04:52.140
That is

04:52.140 --> 04:52.980
He Yan.

04:52.980 --> 04:54.060
The top one

04:55.380 --> 04:56.220
of Yezhou Garrison.

05:09.620 --> 05:10.860
How much did you drink?

05:13.060 --> 05:14.700
Go sober up.

05:20.980 --> 05:21.820
Sober up.

05:24.260 --> 05:25.700
Go sober up.

05:35.500 --> 05:36.340
Wait.

05:37.460 --> 05:38.620
Why should I leave?

05:39.940 --> 05:41.100
You haven't told me

05:41.980 --> 05:45.060
why you didn't
let me join the battalion.

05:45.460 --> 05:46.300
I am

05:46.300 --> 05:47.900
the top one of Yezhou Garrison,

05:50.659 --> 05:52.820
an outstanding candidate.

05:54.060 --> 05:54.900
You

05:55.580 --> 05:57.060
have terrible judgment!

06:04.060 --> 06:06.860
I actually know
why you didn't select me.

06:07.340 --> 06:08.820
You suspect

06:09.420 --> 06:10.700
there's a spy.

06:15.380 --> 06:18.620
But you kept testing me repeatedly.

06:18.820 --> 06:20.740
You clearly know I'm not.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.300
Lei Hou.

06:31.380 --> 06:32.460
It's Lei Hou.

06:38.220 --> 06:39.060
See?

06:39.500 --> 06:40.580
Am I clever?

06:43.100 --> 06:44.340
You are clever indeed.

06:45.180 --> 06:46.060
But clever people

06:46.940 --> 06:48.380
often meet bad ends.

06:48.860 --> 06:50.420
What bad end?

06:51.380 --> 06:52.540
Let me tell you.

06:52.810 --> 06:54.659
I, He Yan,

06:54.900 --> 06:55.860
will one day

06:56.620 --> 06:58.460
become a celebrated general.

07:28.420 --> 07:29.260
He Yan.

07:45.060 --> 07:45.900
Put it back.

07:47.820 --> 07:48.740
He Yan, put it back.

07:49.180 --> 07:50.020
Commander.

07:50.220 --> 07:52.420
Don't be angry.

07:52.659 --> 07:55.420
I'll perform a sword dance for you.

08:53.620 --> 08:54.460
Know you're wrong?

09:02.420 --> 09:03.260
No need to kneel.

09:12.460 --> 09:13.460
Xiao Jue,

09:15.460 --> 09:17.060
do you like me?

09:22.660 --> 09:23.500
Feinu,

09:23.900 --> 09:24.740
this is...?

09:25.580 --> 09:27.860
I will bring dinner for the Commander.
What about you?

09:27.900 --> 09:29.940
The banquet is not over. Why come here?

09:30.380 --> 09:32.260
I've been selected for the battalion.

09:32.780 --> 09:34.140
I wanted to thank the Commander.

09:34.700 --> 09:36.180
But I never expected he...

09:44.060 --> 09:46.020
You must dislike me.

09:46.620 --> 09:47.460
Otherwise,

09:47.700 --> 09:50.820
why wouldn't you
let me join the battalion?

09:53.860 --> 09:54.700
Let go.

09:56.140 --> 09:57.140
This is outrageous.

09:57.220 --> 09:58.300
You have poor judgment.

09:58.300 --> 09:59.700
I'm so disappointed in you.

10:00.460 --> 10:01.300
Tell me.

10:02.260 --> 10:03.940
In terms of looks,

10:04.300 --> 10:05.140
martial skills,

10:05.620 --> 10:07.660
or height,

10:07.740 --> 10:08.620
where am I lacking?

10:10.620 --> 10:12.420
Tell me, where am I lacking?

10:14.420 --> 10:15.260
Height?

10:17.900 --> 10:19.220
Even considering

10:19.620 --> 10:21.860
our bond,

10:22.460 --> 10:23.660
shouldn't you at least

10:24.220 --> 10:25.620
add one more slot?

10:27.220 --> 10:28.580
What bond?

10:30.220 --> 10:31.700
You're reneging on your promise.

10:32.620 --> 10:34.500
I...

10:34.540 --> 10:36.020
I'll prove it to you.

10:36.820 --> 10:37.660
I...

10:39.420 --> 10:40.260
Here we go again.

10:49.060 --> 10:49.900
Let go of me.

11:12.700 --> 11:13.620
Xiao Jue.

11:15.500 --> 11:18.220
If you don't give me that extra slot,

11:19.140 --> 11:20.140
I'll...

11:21.420 --> 11:22.580
I'll...

11:24.020 --> 11:24.940
What will you do?

11:26.860 --> 11:28.060
I'll...

11:30.500 --> 11:31.820
I'll...

11:45.780 --> 11:46.820
Comfortable sleep?

11:49.140 --> 11:50.300
Very cozy.

12:00.260 --> 12:01.100
Mr. He,

12:01.340 --> 12:04.220
you slept soundly in Huaijin's tent.

12:04.780 --> 12:06.100
Truly extraordinary.

12:12.500 --> 12:13.340
The Commander's tent?

12:13.820 --> 12:14.660
Yes.

12:17.700 --> 12:19.340
To make space for you,

12:19.430 --> 12:20.700
last night,

12:20.700 --> 12:22.500
Huaijin squeezed into my place.

12:23.060 --> 12:24.820
Well? Did you remember anything?

13:02.540 --> 13:04.260
Seems like you did.

13:05.060 --> 13:06.780
Did he mention how to punish me?

13:07.500 --> 13:08.340
No.

13:10.020 --> 13:11.700
But he looked furious.

13:13.460 --> 13:14.300
Oh no.

13:16.700 --> 13:18.060
Oh no, oh no.

13:18.060 --> 13:18.900
Forget the battalion.

13:18.900 --> 13:20.100
I might not stay here anymore.

13:20.820 --> 13:22.060
What to do? What to do?

13:22.260 --> 13:23.100
Not necessarily.

13:24.420 --> 13:25.260
Consider this.

13:25.500 --> 13:27.460
You used his treasured sword

13:27.460 --> 13:29.100
to smash his beloved zither,

13:29.100 --> 13:30.140
but he didn't kill you

13:30.220 --> 13:31.460
and even made space for you.

13:32.340 --> 13:33.180
Think about it.

13:33.700 --> 13:35.180
Why did he treat you so kindly?

13:36.380 --> 13:37.620
He must've noticed

13:37.780 --> 13:39.820
your unique physique.

13:44.580 --> 13:45.500
Unique...

13:48.020 --> 13:49.580
Unique physique?

13:54.340 --> 13:55.180
(Could it be)

13:55.460 --> 13:57.060
(he discovered I'm a woman?)

13:57.900 --> 14:00.060
You're a rare prodigy.

14:00.220 --> 14:01.660
That's why he tolerates you.

14:04.980 --> 14:05.820
Am I wrong?

14:29.140 --> 14:29.980
Xiao Jue.

14:30.570 --> 14:32.040
Do you know who I am?

14:33.380 --> 14:35.740
I'm the top one of Yezhou Garrison,

14:38.140 --> 14:39.740
an outstanding candidate.

14:40.420 --> 14:41.540
You

14:41.540 --> 14:43.100
have terrible judgment!

14:44.060 --> 14:44.900
Commander,

14:44.900 --> 14:46.380
please don't be angry.

14:46.620 --> 14:49.260
I'll perform a sword dance for you.

14:54.020 --> 14:55.300
My misbehavior demands

14:56.020 --> 14:57.980
a proper apology to the Commander.

15:29.860 --> 15:30.740
Light on his feet,

15:31.580 --> 15:32.500
with steady breath.

15:32.740 --> 15:33.580
A skilled fighter.

15:36.580 --> 15:40.300
(Invitation)

15:45.300 --> 15:46.140
Summon Cheng Lisu.

15:47.060 --> 15:47.900
Yes.

15:54.540 --> 15:55.380
Commander,

15:55.740 --> 15:57.980
drunken words
shouldn't be taken seriously.

15:58.700 --> 15:59.540
Well,

15:59.820 --> 16:00.660
strike me ten times

16:01.140 --> 16:02.260
and let this matter rest.

16:06.740 --> 16:07.580
Commander,

16:07.820 --> 16:08.660
or perhaps

16:09.220 --> 16:10.820
I'll forfeit three years' pay

16:11.180 --> 16:12.540
to compensate for your zither.

16:13.420 --> 16:14.580
Please show mercy.

16:15.460 --> 16:16.300
Could you

16:17.100 --> 16:18.260
let me join the battalion?

16:19.780 --> 16:20.620
He,

16:21.060 --> 16:23.260
what are you muttering about alone here?

16:23.900 --> 16:25.380
Are you looking for extra training?

16:26.700 --> 16:27.820
Considering an apology.

16:28.300 --> 16:29.340
Considering an apology?

16:31.980 --> 16:32.940
Kneeling on this?

16:35.420 --> 16:36.860
This place is truly vast.

16:37.500 --> 16:38.660
Thank you so much, young man.

16:39.700 --> 16:40.700
If I walked alone,

16:41.540 --> 16:42.660
I'd likely get lost.

16:43.420 --> 16:44.260
(Miss He,)

16:44.540 --> 16:46.980
(in your next life, avoid being
born into He family.)

16:54.700 --> 16:55.540
It's him.

17:02.420 --> 17:03.260
He.

17:03.820 --> 17:05.060
Not picking a weapon?

17:18.660 --> 17:19.500
Sir,

17:19.980 --> 17:20.819
earlier,

17:20.819 --> 17:22.700
who was that person with you?

17:22.940 --> 17:24.619
The Yezhou Magistrate's man.

17:24.940 --> 17:26.700
He delivered an invitation
to our Commander.

17:27.260 --> 17:28.099
Thank you.

17:29.380 --> 17:30.700
(Yezhou Magistrate's man?)

17:31.460 --> 17:32.300
(His severed finger)

17:32.580 --> 17:33.420
(and his voice.)

17:33.900 --> 17:35.660
(It's the man
who hurt me at Yuhua Temple.)

17:36.420 --> 17:37.780
(The He family's henchman.)

17:38.660 --> 17:40.620
(They infiltrated Yezhou Magistrate.)

17:41.180 --> 17:42.180
(What are they planning?)

17:44.140 --> 17:47.050
Yezhou Garrison faces shortages
in military funds and provisions.

17:47.140 --> 17:48.820
I feel deeply concerned.

17:49.140 --> 17:52.060
We sincerely invite
Commander Xiao Jue of Yezhou Garrison

17:52.220 --> 17:53.300
for discussion.

17:53.900 --> 17:56.780
I also hear your nephew Cheng Lisu
is currently at Yezhou Garrison.

17:57.300 --> 17:59.420
Having not seen him for years,

17:59.460 --> 18:00.540
I feel nostalgic.

18:01.020 --> 18:03.380
Hoping the Commander
will bring him along.

18:03.820 --> 18:06.020
(Invitation)
Yezhou Magistrate, Sun Xiangfu.

18:08.540 --> 18:10.700
He's inviting you
for an official matter.

18:10.900 --> 18:11.740
Why include me?

18:12.060 --> 18:13.740
I have no old bonds to reminisce about.

18:16.380 --> 18:17.220
You don't remember?

18:22.780 --> 18:24.710
(Yezhou Magistrate, Sun Xiangfu)

18:27.260 --> 18:28.220
Sun Xiangfu!

18:30.060 --> 18:31.780
When he came to the capital years ago,

18:31.780 --> 18:33.500
his wife arranged a marriage for you.

18:34.380 --> 18:35.340
Oh, no.

18:35.340 --> 18:37.180
He'll probably lure me there first,

18:37.500 --> 18:38.380
then detain me,

18:38.700 --> 18:40.620
and send me back
to Yaojing for marriage!

18:41.180 --> 18:42.020
This...

18:43.140 --> 18:43.980
Huaijin.

18:44.900 --> 18:45.740
Uncle.

18:45.860 --> 18:47.720
You have to save me.

18:47.720 --> 18:50.180
You can't watch your best friend,

18:50.180 --> 18:51.220
your adorable nephew,

18:51.220 --> 18:52.340
jump into hellfire.

18:59.820 --> 19:00.940
Is it that terrible?

19:01.340 --> 19:02.260
Absolutely.

19:02.700 --> 19:03.780
You know full well

19:04.140 --> 19:06.100
Miss Song and I despise each other.

19:06.220 --> 19:07.540
She spends all day tinkering with

19:07.580 --> 19:08.540
strange concoctions.

19:09.180 --> 19:10.500
I'll become her lab rat,

19:10.500 --> 19:12.140
slowly tortured to death.

19:12.660 --> 19:13.500
I'd rather

19:14.020 --> 19:15.460
end it all now!

19:15.580 --> 19:16.420
Wait.

19:16.900 --> 19:17.740
Uncle,

19:17.740 --> 19:19.300
I knew you wouldn't abandon me.

19:20.180 --> 19:21.180
Our bond is so strong.

19:23.740 --> 19:25.140
W-What...?

19:27.500 --> 19:28.900
What are you doing?

19:34.660 --> 19:36.020
Yinqiu is sharp.

19:37.340 --> 19:38.180
I'll lend it to you.

19:39.050 --> 19:41.580
You're joking?

19:42.140 --> 19:42.980
Uncle,

19:43.580 --> 19:46.820
you wouldn't really
let me die, would you?

19:50.780 --> 19:52.220
Don't you want to end it all?

19:52.820 --> 19:53.660
I...

19:54.260 --> 19:55.720
I was just kidding.

20:06.620 --> 20:07.460
Mr. Cheng,

20:08.340 --> 20:10.380
I heard someone sent
the Commander an invitation.

20:11.060 --> 20:11.900
Mr. He,

20:12.020 --> 20:13.140
I'm going to die.

20:13.580 --> 20:14.420
When the time comes,

20:14.620 --> 20:16.100
burn lots of joss paper for me.

20:16.780 --> 20:18.260
Mr. Cheng, what's wrong?

20:18.860 --> 20:20.060
I'm going with Huaijin

20:20.100 --> 20:22.540
to visit the Yezhou Magistrate.

20:22.940 --> 20:24.300
That's a dangerous place.

20:25.020 --> 20:25.900
Dangerous place?

20:26.260 --> 20:27.540
With the Commander, why fear?

20:27.980 --> 20:30.140
Unless in the magistrate's mansion,

20:30.500 --> 20:31.420
there are people

20:31.580 --> 20:32.740
stronger than the Commander?

20:33.340 --> 20:35.420
Sun Xiangfu is more terrifying.

20:36.020 --> 20:37.740
His wife was my marriage matchmaker.

20:38.140 --> 20:38.980
This time,

20:39.220 --> 20:40.820
not even Xiao Jue can protect me.

20:42.740 --> 20:45.140
So the Commander is visiting Yezhou

20:45.140 --> 20:46.580
to discuss your marriage?

20:46.740 --> 20:47.580
No.

20:47.700 --> 20:49.260
He is going for an official matter.

20:49.420 --> 20:51.780
Only I must go through this.

20:52.500 --> 20:54.310
Official matter?

20:54.310 --> 20:55.300
What is that?

20:55.300 --> 20:58.060
The Yezhou Magistrate wants
the Commander's personal presence?

20:58.140 --> 20:59.300
He's got some nerve.

21:00.060 --> 21:00.900
No.

21:00.980 --> 21:02.660
Huaijin is going
for provisions and funds.

21:03.060 --> 21:03.900
I'm just...

21:04.200 --> 21:05.180
Hold on, Mr. He.

21:05.580 --> 21:06.980
Why do you keep mentioning Huaijin?

21:07.380 --> 21:09.460
I'm the one in hot water, not him.

21:11.460 --> 21:12.300
Mr. Cheng,

21:12.700 --> 21:14.620
I just thought he'd be capable enough.

21:14.940 --> 21:16.260
If you can't rely on him,

21:17.140 --> 21:18.420
let me help brainstorm ideas.

21:19.780 --> 21:20.620
Come on, let's go.

21:21.300 --> 21:22.380
Let me think.

21:23.420 --> 21:24.260
Commander,

21:24.780 --> 21:25.660
Sun Xiangfu has been

21:26.100 --> 21:27.980
dodging the funds and provisions issue,

21:28.260 --> 21:29.510
but at this critical moment,

21:29.510 --> 21:30.540
he suddenly invites you.

21:30.660 --> 21:31.700
It must be a trap.

21:31.780 --> 21:33.660
This is clearly an ambush banquet.

21:34.220 --> 21:35.060
Should we decline?

21:35.980 --> 21:36.820
If I don't go,

21:37.260 --> 21:38.500
they won't give up.

21:39.140 --> 21:40.620
A stab in the back is hard to dodge.

21:41.460 --> 21:42.580
We should strike first.

21:43.220 --> 21:44.060
Moreover,

21:44.540 --> 21:47.140
doesn't Sun Xiangfu
still owe us for the provisions?

21:47.340 --> 21:48.180
Commander.

21:48.180 --> 21:49.300
I've just received news.

21:49.660 --> 21:51.900
The Inspector
of the Ministry of War, Chu Zhao,

21:51.900 --> 21:52.820
is coming to Yezhou.

21:53.260 --> 21:54.620
I think you know this man.

21:54.740 --> 21:57.580
Top scholar in 19th Year of Qingyuan,
Xu Jingfu's prized disciple.

21:58.260 --> 22:00.500
He's been serving
Xu Jingfu all these years.

22:01.380 --> 22:02.220
I find he just

22:02.700 --> 22:03.900
returned from Que City.

22:08.300 --> 22:09.140
Continue.

22:09.700 --> 22:10.540
The Que City battle

22:10.620 --> 22:11.460
hurt your reputation.

22:11.780 --> 22:13.140
It's unclear if he's involved.

22:13.420 --> 22:14.260
Now in Yezhou,

22:14.700 --> 22:16.460
his intentions here remain unknown.

22:17.140 --> 22:18.460
I've dealt with Chu Zhao before.

22:19.260 --> 22:21.460
He suffered mistreatment
in his family initially

22:21.820 --> 22:22.860
until he earned his title,

22:23.740 --> 22:25.460
and then his family
changed their attitude.

22:26.100 --> 22:28.020
Now, he serves under Xu Jingfu.

22:28.180 --> 22:31.140
Undoubtedly, he is using
Xu Jingfu's influence for advancement.

22:31.700 --> 22:33.060
Regardless of his true motives,

22:33.820 --> 22:36.220
he ultimately works for Xu Jingfu.

22:37.100 --> 22:37.940
What a coincidence.

22:38.860 --> 22:39.980
Returning from Que City.

22:41.180 --> 22:43.140
Those rumors must stem from him.

22:43.660 --> 22:44.820
During this Yezhou mission,

22:45.700 --> 22:46.820
stay vigilant against him.

22:46.980 --> 22:47.820
Yes.

22:47.860 --> 22:48.700
Commander.

22:48.860 --> 22:50.060
This mission is dangerous.

22:50.420 --> 22:51.660
Mr. Cheng can't fight.

22:52.060 --> 22:52.900
Taking him along

22:53.100 --> 22:54.340
could be problematic.

22:54.940 --> 22:56.060
Cheng Lisu isn't going.

22:56.380 --> 22:57.340
He Yan will go.

23:04.660 --> 23:05.500
What's wrong?

23:06.300 --> 23:07.140
No problem.

23:07.660 --> 23:09.700
Commander, don't you doubt
He Yan's identity?

23:10.100 --> 23:11.700
Why bring him along then?

23:14.300 --> 23:16.460
Leaving him here worries me.

23:16.940 --> 23:18.300
Since he's so eager to go,

23:19.140 --> 23:19.980
let him join me.

23:20.780 --> 23:22.020
He boasts of his skills.

23:22.660 --> 23:23.780
This banquet will test

23:24.660 --> 23:26.220
whether his claims hold true.

23:34.780 --> 23:36.140
(Sun Xiangfu has been withholding)

23:36.220 --> 23:37.740
(the military provisions and funds,)

23:38.740 --> 23:41.420
(but now suddenly invites
Xiao Jue to negotiate.)

23:42.540 --> 23:44.100
(He Rufei and Sun Xiangfu)

23:44.780 --> 23:46.020
(must be plotting something.)

23:46.740 --> 23:47.580
(Their target)

23:47.900 --> 23:48.940
(is Yezhou Garrison,)

23:49.780 --> 23:51.020
(perhaps even Xiao Jue.)

23:53.420 --> 23:54.420
(This trip to Yezhou,)

23:55.100 --> 23:56.340
(whether for the garrison,)

23:56.620 --> 23:57.460
(Xiao Jue,)

23:57.740 --> 23:58.700
(or me,)

23:59.820 --> 24:02.140
(I must uncover the truth.)

24:22.500 --> 24:23.340
Commander.

24:24.180 --> 24:25.020
You seem distracted.

24:25.740 --> 24:26.580
What troubles you?

24:27.460 --> 24:28.300
Commander,

24:28.540 --> 24:29.940
I drank too much last night.

24:30.100 --> 24:30.980
Sorry

24:31.500 --> 24:32.340
for offending you.

24:32.540 --> 24:34.620
But must you stare at me like this?

24:34.940 --> 24:37.140
I've already thought of
a way to redeem myself.

24:37.900 --> 24:39.900
So you take Cheng Lisu's place
and go to Yezhou

24:40.260 --> 24:41.180
just to atone?

24:42.660 --> 24:43.820
Not entirely.

24:44.260 --> 24:45.500
Aside from easing your burdens,

24:46.060 --> 24:47.060
it's for my own sake.

24:47.860 --> 24:48.700
For yourself?

24:51.260 --> 24:53.420
I want to join the battalion
to make achievements.

24:53.740 --> 24:54.700
If this trip

24:54.740 --> 24:56.460
can make you change your opinion of me,

24:56.780 --> 24:57.620
then next time,

24:57.820 --> 24:58.980
the slot for the battalion

24:59.180 --> 25:00.020
will be mine.

25:00.380 --> 25:01.780
Such a golden opportunity.

25:01.940 --> 25:03.100
Of course I'll seize it.

25:08.820 --> 25:09.660
Good.

25:10.300 --> 25:11.380
Let's see

25:12.020 --> 25:13.460
how you'll change my opinion.

25:39.580 --> 25:40.420
Commander.

25:40.420 --> 25:41.260
Mr. Cheng.

25:41.380 --> 25:42.220
Mr. Feinu.

25:42.540 --> 25:43.380
Morning.

25:43.860 --> 25:44.700
Morning.

25:49.980 --> 25:51.180
I am Cheng Lisu

25:51.500 --> 25:52.620
from the capital.

25:53.020 --> 25:54.780
I love mushroom and chicken stew,

25:54.860 --> 25:55.900
hate congee,

25:56.260 --> 25:58.180
avoid peanuts
and love cleanliness the most.

25:58.340 --> 26:00.260
I burn incense and bathe daily.

26:00.780 --> 26:01.620
Well done. Well done.

26:01.740 --> 26:02.820
You've memorized that well.

26:04.060 --> 26:06.100
As the saying goes,
clothes make the man.

26:08.500 --> 26:09.340
This looks better.

26:13.700 --> 26:14.540
Mr. He,

26:14.540 --> 26:15.780
your demeanor today

26:15.980 --> 26:16.900
almost rivals mine.

26:17.460 --> 26:18.540
You flatter me.

26:20.060 --> 26:21.660
Commander, what do you think?

26:21.660 --> 26:22.700
Do I look

26:22.900 --> 26:25.700
charming and dashing?

26:26.420 --> 26:27.260
You're even

26:29.340 --> 26:30.580
shorter than Cheng Lisu.

26:33.340 --> 26:34.180
Who says that?

26:34.620 --> 26:35.460
About my height.

26:36.260 --> 26:37.100
When are you leaving?

26:45.860 --> 26:46.700
Go away.

26:53.050 --> 26:57.540
(Yezhou City)

27:02.540 --> 27:03.380
Young Master.

27:03.620 --> 27:05.620
Ding Yi has made contact
with Sun Xiangfu.

27:06.180 --> 27:08.380
The invitation for Xiao Jue
to come to Yezhou City

27:08.740 --> 27:10.500
must now be in his hands.

27:10.820 --> 27:11.660
Good.

27:12.380 --> 27:13.220
Found anything

27:13.500 --> 27:14.340
about the Sun family?

27:14.740 --> 27:15.900
As you instructed,

27:16.060 --> 27:18.100
we targeted Sun Xiangfu's useless son.

27:18.780 --> 27:19.700
Fruitful results.

27:20.100 --> 27:21.700
Sun Ling is a lecherous man,

27:21.900 --> 27:22.980
abusing his father's power

27:23.260 --> 27:25.420
to tyrannize Yezhou's citizens
and harass women.

27:25.660 --> 27:27.740
The people are afraid
to speak their anger openly.

27:28.060 --> 27:29.780
Sun Xiangfu is cautious
and stays in line,

27:30.620 --> 27:31.460
but he is responsible

27:31.860 --> 27:32.700
for his son.

27:33.220 --> 27:34.940
His son will surely drag him down.

27:35.740 --> 27:36.580
Young Master.

27:36.620 --> 27:37.460
In that case,

27:37.700 --> 27:39.540
shouldn't we head
to the Sun residence now?

27:39.820 --> 27:41.260
The stage is set,

27:41.660 --> 27:43.540
and the actors will soon arrive.

27:44.380 --> 27:45.820
We'll move once they're here.

27:46.740 --> 27:47.660
Missing this chance

27:48.340 --> 27:49.340
would be a shame.

28:06.700 --> 28:07.540
Gentlemen,

28:07.540 --> 28:08.700
please come inside.

28:13.980 --> 28:14.820
This way.

28:17.140 --> 28:17.980
Sir,

28:17.980 --> 28:18.820
please.

28:22.300 --> 28:27.210
(Guests Filling the Halls)

28:28.900 --> 28:29.740
Commander.

28:33.300 --> 28:34.140
Uncle.

28:34.140 --> 28:35.540
Why not stay at the Sun residence?

28:36.140 --> 28:36.980
No rush.

28:40.220 --> 28:42.020
How many rooms would you like?

28:42.420 --> 28:43.260
Three.

28:43.460 --> 28:44.300
Two.

28:47.100 --> 28:48.100
We two share a room.

28:48.900 --> 28:50.300
Why should I share a room with you?

28:50.580 --> 28:51.420
Because...

28:53.500 --> 28:55.980
I'm your nephew.

28:55.980 --> 28:58.100
You won't even pay for another room?

28:59.700 --> 29:00.540
Three rooms.

29:00.540 --> 29:01.380
Alright.

29:02.940 --> 29:03.780
You...

29:03.860 --> 29:05.220
Don't leave your room tonight.

29:09.060 --> 29:09.900
Waiter.

29:09.900 --> 29:10.740
Coming.

29:11.860 --> 29:14.260
Do you serve
mushroom and chicken stew here?

29:14.300 --> 29:15.140
Yes.

29:15.500 --> 29:16.340
Bring us a portion.

29:16.340 --> 29:17.980
Uncle, you know well

29:18.020 --> 29:20.380
how much I adore
mushroom and chicken stew.

29:22.540 --> 29:23.660
Mushroom and chicken stew,

29:24.060 --> 29:25.060
Eight-Treasure Duck,

29:25.300 --> 29:26.500
vegetables, soup,

29:26.740 --> 29:27.580
and six steamed buns.

29:28.300 --> 29:29.140
Okay.

29:29.940 --> 29:31.460
(Just having one more room)

29:31.500 --> 29:32.620
(and ordering one dish)

29:33.100 --> 29:34.980
(deserves those judgmental looks?)

29:35.340 --> 29:36.660
(So stingy.)

29:37.940 --> 29:38.780
Wait.

29:39.740 --> 29:40.660
I'll have

29:41.020 --> 29:43.060
spicy tripe strips, sesame rolls,

29:43.060 --> 29:45.540
shredded chicken with cucumber,
five-flavored steamed gluten,

29:45.540 --> 29:46.540
aromatic young pigeon,

29:46.540 --> 29:48.420
and also that

29:49.100 --> 29:50.180
mung bean dough noodles.

29:50.180 --> 29:51.780
Yes, all of them.

29:51.780 --> 29:53.180
- Okay.
- Can you finish all this?

29:57.700 --> 29:58.540
Uncle,

29:59.060 --> 30:00.580
you wouldn't let your nephew

30:00.780 --> 30:01.940
go hungry, would you?

30:06.740 --> 30:07.740
Serve what he ordered.

30:08.220 --> 30:09.060
Alright.

30:27.460 --> 30:28.300
Enjoy your meal.

30:29.780 --> 30:31.210
Since these are your favorite food,

30:31.700 --> 30:33.300
I naturally let you eat them.

30:33.980 --> 30:35.140
But I taught you this.

30:35.580 --> 30:36.540
Save and thrive,

30:36.980 --> 30:37.940
waste and perish.

30:38.980 --> 30:39.940
Don't waste anything.

30:45.460 --> 30:46.980
(I've really overdone it now.)

31:12.500 --> 31:14.820
I'm stuffed!

31:15.820 --> 31:17.830
Now that I'm full, I'm getting drowsy.

31:17.830 --> 31:20.220
This bed is amazingly comfortable!

31:22.420 --> 31:25.500
I'll definitely sleep well.

31:26.420 --> 31:28.220
He eats well and sleeps soundly.

31:28.780 --> 31:31.260
If you're still energetic,
play chess with me.

32:03.820 --> 32:04.660
Commander,

32:04.740 --> 32:05.740
really playing chess?

32:06.380 --> 32:07.220
But I...

32:12.940 --> 32:14.500
Yezhou City has unexpected people.

32:15.180 --> 32:16.220
This is getting exciting.

32:16.740 --> 32:18.100
Investigate the Sun family again.

32:18.580 --> 32:20.420
Find their recent tax records.

32:20.900 --> 32:22.380
Let's see how Sun Xiangfu

32:23.060 --> 32:24.780
claims military provisions are lacking

32:24.980 --> 32:26.220
and he can't allocate rations.

32:26.980 --> 32:27.820
Yes.

32:28.740 --> 32:29.580
Commander,

32:29.940 --> 32:30.780
what about He Yan?

32:31.180 --> 32:32.300
I'll keep watch personally.

33:03.710 --> 33:05.860
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:05.970 --> 33:09.890
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:10.060 --> 33:12.010
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:12.100 --> 33:17.030
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:29.130 --> 33:30.530
♪I've seen the mountains♪

33:30.730 --> 33:32.150
♪And trodden through ice♪

33:32.420 --> 33:35.230
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

33:35.540 --> 33:36.930
♪Destiny is my creed♪

33:36.990 --> 33:38.390
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

33:38.530 --> 33:40.330
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

33:41.530 --> 33:43.000
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

33:43.170 --> 33:44.460
♪Gazing through the mire♪

33:44.630 --> 33:47.030
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

33:47.220 --> 33:49.270
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

33:50.410 --> 33:52.240
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

33:54.200 --> 33:57.120
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

33:57.210 --> 33:59.870
♪There must always be a longing♪

34:00.320 --> 34:05.390
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

34:05.720 --> 34:07.730
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:08.040 --> 34:11.690
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:11.929 --> 34:13.820
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:13.850 --> 34:17.699
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:18.050 --> 34:19.989
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:20.170 --> 34:23.989
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:24.250 --> 34:30.000
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

34:30.889 --> 34:36.360
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

